===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|blody}}, {{m|enm|blodi}}, from {{inh|en|ang|blōdiġ}}, {{m|ang|blōdeġ|t=bloody}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*blōdag}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*blōþagaz|t=bloody}}, equivalent to {{af|en|blood|-y|id2=adjectival}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|bläidich}}, {{m|stq|blöidig}}, {{m|stq|blouderch|t=bloody}}, {{cog|fy|bloedich|t=bloody}}, {{cog|nl|bloedig|t=bloody}}, {{cog|nds-de|blödig|t=bloody}}, {{cog|de|blutig|t=bloody}}, {{cog|da|blodig|t=bloody}}, {{cog|sv|blodig|t=bloody}}, {{cog|fo|blóðigur|t=bloody}}, {{cog|is|blóðugur|t=bloody}}.  See [[:w:bloody|Wikipedia]] for thoughts on sense evolution.

